                                "sense_id": "dc672ec8-765d-34a9-8b22-f2c7d46e7505",
                                "text": "A 75 ¢ book must look 40 ¢ better to the distributor and wholesaler, because if one peppercorn of doubt that people will pay 75 ¢ for the book gets thrown into the distribution mill, the books may never leave their cartons […]"
